<title>PAKISTAN: Pakistan cotton rates close unchanged.</title>
<headline>Pakistan cotton rates close unchanged.</headline>
<dateline>KARACHI, Pakistan 1997-02-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Pakistani cotton rates closed unchanged on Tuesday with spinners yet to return to the market after the Moslem Eid al-Fitr holiday, dealers said.</p>
<p>In the kerb market, NIAB-78 was quoted at 2,250 to 2,300 rupees per maund (37.32 kg), dealer Kishin Chand said, adding that rates were likely to open unchanged on Wednesday.</p>
<p>Tuesday's KCA official spot rates in rupees per maund:</p>
<p>				     Tuesday	    Feb 6</p>
<p>    NIAB-78			2,322.50	   2,322.50</p>
<p>    K-68			   2,515		2,515</p>
<p>    MNH-93			 2,525		2,525</p>
<p>($1 = 40.22 rupees) -- Ibrahim Khan 9221-5685192</p>
</text>
